  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 864f32d36e36a5644aa8fbd495f2626a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dayne1.1.2.1.2.1.2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: I've studied dragons my whole life. They are peaceful, they keep to themselves
    and only engage with humans if they are threatened. The only recorded dragon
    attack on humans was the Screegle Town slaughter, over two hundred years ago.
    Which happened because some fool stole the dragon's eggs. But everyone seems
    to forget that part of the story. People around here need to read more. I implore
    you, do not take the eggs to this doctor. Return them to their nest.
  option1:
    text: Okay. I'll reconsider my choice.
    next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: da51ea874160b6b4b902200e9b750267, type: 2}
    action: 0
  option2:
    text: I don't care. The Doctor made a good offer.
    next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6af44788e195a30498f2ff010c49994c, type: 2}
    action: 0
